EmailTemplate.textOnly:
``` E&O Insurance Expiration Alert Dear {!Recipient.Name}, This is an important reminder that your Errors & Omissions (E&O) Insurance is approaching expiration.
Agent Name {!Recipient.Name} Agent Status {!Contact.Agent_Status__c} E&O Insurance Expiration Date {!Contact.E_O_Termination_Date__c}
Please renew your E&O Insurance before the expiration date to avoid interruption in appointment eligibility and compliance status. If you have already renewed your insurance, please disregard this notification. Thank you, Compliance Team ```
